WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.405 --> 00:00:03.368
查看系统代理接管状态 / Inspect system proxy ownership

2
00:00:03.368 --> 00:00:09.619
Restore 恢复原路由 / Restore the original system routing

3
00:00:09.619 --> 00:00:12.416
确认监听器没有因此停止 / Confirm the listener is still available

4
00:00:12.416 --> 00:00:19.118
通过 Settings 重新 Enable / Enable again through Settings

5
00:00:19.118 --> 00:00:22.119
返回 Capture 确认录制开启 / Return to Capture and ensure Recording is on

6
00:00:22.119 --> 00:00:24.970
暂停 Recording / Pause Recording

7
00:00:24.970 --> 00:00:27.870
暂停不等于 Restore / Pausing is not Restore

8
00:00:27.870 --> 00:00:34.121
结束演示前恢复原路由 / Restore routing before finishing
